# The expenses example's scripted session (examples/odin/expenses against examples/go/expenses,
# gates/go-apps.sh expenses): every image must be byte-identical between the two. Window
# coordinates (the images are twice the size): What 146,92, Amount 430,92, the Category select
# 714,92, Add expense 791,134 (lower once the fields show messages), the rows' delete buttons x 526.
size 860 560
frame
frame
advance 1000
shot 01-start.png
# Add with every field empty: three messages
click 791 134
advance 300
shot 02-errors.png
# typing in What clears its message
click 146 92
type Coffee
advance 300
shot 03-what-typed.png
# an amount that is not a number
click 430 92
type abc
advance 300
shot 04-amount-bad.png
key ctrl-a
type 3.20
advance 300
shot 05-amount-ok.png
click 714 92
advance 300
shot 06-select-open.png
# the select's menu: Transport (626,164)
click 626 164
advance 300
shot 07-category.png
# Add: the fields clear, the list gets a row, the chart grows, a toast says so
click 791 134
advance 500
shot 08-added.png
# Enter in a field adds too: an amount of 0 is refused, then 9.90 goes in
click 146 92
type Lunch
click 430 92
type 0
key enter
advance 300
shot 09-zero.png
key ctrl-a
type 9.90
key enter
advance 500
shot 10-added-by-enter.png
# the first row's delete button
click 526 183
advance 300
shot 11-deleted.png
